                                                "sense_id": "bd23a6e7-163d-3c68-b8f0-e1b7c39ab0c9",
                                                "text": "the bible mentioned in the oath emitted this day , by Andrew Murison , as the book and bible from whence the printed leaves , battered on the B. L. Coy's notes , now challenged as forged , are alleged to be taken"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
